      "full_text" : "@kevinw1971 @emceeka97376771 And the mass. The gyroscope provides a model for observing destabilization sequences, which may be mathematically described if the inputs are all known. An ideal model would factor the Earth's mass distribution, combined with the observed nutation, and all of the dynamic inputs…",
