      "full_text" : "@RrnRaindeer And glaciation for sure. I don’t think anyone has yet tried to suggest that a glacial lake flow could have created what these seem to be - 500m crest-crest current ripples. Glacial ice action doesn’t create morphology like this. I’m not sure what else could have formed them…",
