      "full_text" : "This little mapping project has evolved [1]. The default dataset now includes 250 flood stories [2], 13 wind accounts [3] and 239 of the entries listed in the events database which had a geographic location associated with them [4], totalling 494 data points thus far. Layers can… https://t.co/wL627Rh5Ch https://t.co/OA8R1d6kY1",
