      "full_text" : "@GuitoShow Similar MCR's are easily seen in Africa, in Sudan and Mauritania, only they'r right near the equator and couldn't possibly have been formed by glacial lake flows. Only inundation by a sea or an ocean could have created ripples of this size.\nhttps://t.co/CpYYhERund…",
