      "possibly_sensitive" : false,
      "created_at" : "Wed Jul 03 19:12:06 +0000 2024",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Using the GCR chord length equation [1] to determine water depth based on ripple size, I arrive at a water depth of 1,200m. I used this 10km long sample to determine average slope (0.0018) and chord length (555m) [2]. Be good if someone could check this.\n[1]… https://t.co/9GxRBZ0NMK",
