      "full_text" : "@Hurmanetar8 @EthicalSkeptic Magnetic reversals as recorded in paleomagnetic records can only be observed on a scale of many thousands or millions of years (paleo proxies have limited temporal resolution). ECDO crustal shifts are expected to be fast &amp; frequent and would be invisible in the magnetic record.",
