      "full_text" : "@s36371222 ..The moon’s gravitational field is tidally locked/coupled to the earth, resulting in us always seeing the same side from earth. This tidal locking may have come about as a result of such events - ECDO suggests that Earth’s gravitational field may have been previously disrupted.",
