      "full_text" : "The Balkåkra Ritual Object [1], considered to have originated from an  \"Astronomy and Sun Cult\" in Sweden circa 1750 BCE appears to possibly be  a calendar device. The number of repetitions in the patterns of the  rings are factors of the lunar month, orbital periods of Saturn,… https://t.co/UT2Tk20ng9",
