      "possibly_sensitive" : false,
      "created_at" : "Sun Jun 16 15:53:28 +0000 2024",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Approx. 0.63 gigajoules (GJ) of energy would be required to establish a 10,000 tesla magnetic field. The LHC can store up to 9GJ of energy in its dipole magnets during operation. This stored energy is primarily due to the magnetic field energy stored in the superconducting coils. https://t.co/4PQqXGZnwG",
