      "created_at" : "Thu Jun 06 08:19:57 +0000 2024",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Could this mass aerial bombardment of the northern hemisphere 12.5ky ago have imparted sufficient energy to destabilize the Earth, thus commencing the oscillation which has continued to this day? This would sensibly align with a pyramid construction date of around 9-10ky ago.",
      "lang" : "en",
