      "full_text" : "Encke's companions are the Taurid meteor complex - the most prolific and frequent meteor shower seen on Earth, and they happened to be on almost exactly the same trajectory past Earth in 1903 when the Tunguska Event occurred. https://t.co/3vtLhEw2Ey",
