      "created_at" : "Wed May 15 09:11:11 +0000 2024",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "“In 1989,Landscheidt forecast a period of sunspot minima after 1990, accompanied by increased cold, with a stronger minimum and more intense cold which should peak in 2030, which he described as the \"Landscheidt Minimum\"",
