      "full_text" : "@LilithDatura @pshs04 The one object which has the same apparent diameter as the sun when viewed from near earth is the moon, which just happened to be between the earth and sun at that moment. Solar eclipses can and do occur from the perspective of near earth observatories. There is no mystery here.",
