      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@jvin248 @BetruetoitUK @odc_catch_all My question to the 6k cycle is - where is the historic and geological evidence to support it? In working through hundreds of geology, palaeontology and archaeology papers and books over the past several months, I cannot say that I have found any concentration around this period.",
